[recv] {"method":"item/completed","params":{"item":{"type":"commandExecution","id":"call_yIm9qbawyGzWwl4SnAK6SXyp","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"sed -n '1,180p' /root/.agents/skills/tscircuit/elements/chip.md\"","cwd":"/workspace","processId":"85073","source":"unifiedExecStartup","status":"completed","commandActions":[{"type":"read","command":"sed -n '1,180p' /root/.agents/skills/tscircuit/elements/chip.md","name":"chip.md","path":"/root/.agents/skills/tscircuit/elements/chip.md"}],"aggregatedOutput":"# `<chip />`\n\nUsed to represent virtually any single-part electronic component. Extremely flexible and supports custom footprints and pin arrangements.\n\n## Example\n\n```tsx\nimport type { CommonLayoutProps } from \"tscircuit\"\n\ninterface Props extends CommonLayoutProps {\n  name: string\n}\n\nexport const A555Timer = (props: Props) => {\n  return (\n   <board width=\"10mm\" height=\"10mm\">\n    <chip\n      footprint=\"soic8\"\n      pinLabels={{\n        pin1: \"VCC\",\n        pin2: \"DISCH\",\n        pin3: \"THRES\",\n        pin4: \"CTRL\",\n        pin5: \"GND\",\n        pin6: \"TRIG\",\n        pin7: \"OUT\",\n        pin8: \"RESET\"\n      }}\n      {...props}\n    />\n  </board>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Props\n\nCommonly used: `manufacturerPartNumber`, `pinLabels`, `showPinAliases`, `pcbPinLabels`, `schPinArrangement`, `schPortArrangement`, `pinCompatibleVariants`, `schPinStyle`\n\n## References\n\n- Props: [ChipProps](https://github.com/tscircuit/props#chipprops-chip)\n- Source: [lib/components/chip.ts](https://github.com/tscircuit/props/blob/main/lib/components/chip.ts)\n- Local docs: [docs/docs/elements/chip.mdx](../docs/docs/elements/chip.mdx)\n","exitCode":0,"durationMs":0},"threadId":"019e8ebd-60bc-75b1-a46a-4937607d5d0e","turnId":"019e8ebd-60c9-7312-b700-7779729e8d51","completedAtMs":1780511281073}}
